","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"American (New), Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"gcboPfvHc2Kv8s_f5L0HIw","review_id":"DQ-ITSOi-58XaeWaKjDESA","date":"2021-04-18T14:32:06","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9272123575210571,"text_excerpt":"Definitely add this spot to your list for Happy Hour in New Orleans! Their HH is daily from 3-6pm and includes specials on drinks plus half off of their flatbread selections and half off of their deviled egg apps. Other than that, the food options are a bit expensive for what you get (flatbread is normally $15-16 without HH discount). The vibe inside is really cool and it's a lot larger than what it looks like on the outside. Music was 5/5 for the indie electronic music fans. Service was also great and personable! A place to visit before dinner or when you want a chill happy hour. There's also a pool connected to the bar for hotel guests, which was pretty cool!"},{"business_id":"gcboPfvHc2Kv8s_f5L0HIw","review_id":"CXFY2hqUye-BwLZ5OvfF1Q","date":"2020-12-23T22:27:27","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9182223677635193,"text_excerpt":"Hot spot! I love finding new places to writec about. Batture Bistro + Bar just opened a few weeks ago. I wanted to check them out and try their menu. The bar area has a very cozy & chill feel to it. You can chill by the fireplace and delight in cocktails by the poolside deck. Oh, the pool is heated. There's also a climate-controlled porch that is designed for socialites to sip in style. I am here for the dining al fresco. We ordered the artisan flatbread pizza. The options are a wide array ranging from Prosciutto, Italian sausage , Creole tomato, and blackened chicken. There are so many fabulous cocktails. Pictured below, are the Blood - Orange Revenge and Sidecar. I will try the Hot & Sp..."},{"business_id":"gcboPfvHc2Kv8s_f5L0HIw","review_id":"7SY1uueQhuUcglBo_4CbLg","date":"2021-06-28T19:28:22","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9054043889045715,"text_excerpt":"I was invited to a brunch for a close friend's birthday and I absolutely loved the space and the service. This place is it! Upon entering the various spacious main room, there were tables and a lounge area so to speak and there was plenty of space. I was there on a weekend and there was not many people so I suggest that you go now!! We gathered in the glass room that sits facing Decatur and also has a lovely view of the pool. The service was perfect. Our entire experience was on point from the beginning until the end. Everyone in the group complimented the food. All I had was the waffles with pralines and bacon. Both were delicious. I can't wait to return."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"gcboPfvHc2Kv8s_f5L0HIw","photo_id":"IFKfhiwbc9qNtszRWAskJA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/IFKfhiwbc9qNtszRWAskJA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9225187301635742},{"business_id":"gcboPfvHc2Kv8s_f5L0HIw","photo_id":"lxMown62WpKMvyznt4d9pQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/lxMown62WpKMvyznt4d9pQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9060206413269043},{"business_id":"gcboPfvHc2Kv8s_f5L0HIw","ph